        "r": 527.2688760000001,
        "b": 670.8231569281769
      },
      "content": "Do not touch any device in the Electric Control Panel and Operating Panel and in which the mark           is located.",
      "section_id": "sec_2",
      "parent_section_id": null,
      "section_level": 1,
      "section_path": [
        {
          "id": "sec_2",
          "title": "2. General Safety Precautions"
        }
      ],
      "page": 16,
      "chunk_hint": "continue",
      "semantic_role": "description",
      "source": "pdf_text"
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0122",
      "reading_order": 133,
      "section": "2. General Safety Precautions",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 106.38077999999996,
        "t": 662.654864,
        "r": 527.2588560000007,
        "b": 636.8032529281769
      },
      "content": "Prior to operating the machine, always close the door and check if safety shield located. If the door opened, immediately turn off the main power.",
      "section_id": "sec_2",
      "parent_section_id": null,
      "section_level": 1,
      "section_path": [
        {
          "id": "sec_2",
          "title": "2. General Safety Precautions"
        }
      ],
      "page": 16,
      "chunk_hint": "continue",
      "semantic_role": "description",
      "source": "pdf_text"
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0123",
      "reading_order": 134,
      "section": "2. General Safety Precautions",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 106.379778,
        "t": 388.694768,
        "r": 314.70559799999995,
        "b": 345.8031449281768
      },
      "content": "Remember where the Emer-gency stop switch  is  to  operate  it  anywhere  at  all times.",
      "section_id": "sec_2",
      "parent_section_id": null,
      "section_level": 1,
      "section_path": [
        {
          "id": "sec_2",
          "title": "2. General Safety Precautions"
        }
      ],
      "page": 16,
      "chunk_hint": "continue",
      "semantic_role": "description",
      "source": "pdf_text"
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0124",
      "reading_order": 135,
      "section": "2. General Safety Precautions",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 106.37977799999999,
        "t": 337.694972,
        "r": 314.75068800000025,
        "b": 294.8033489281768
      },
      "content": "Before operating the machine, check if the switches are functioned correctly to avoid malfunction.",
      "section_id": "sec_2",
      "parent_section_id": null,
      "section_level": 1,
      "section_path": [
        {
          "id": "sec_2",
          "title": "2. General Safety Precautions"
        }
      ],
      "page": 16,
      "chunk_hint": "continue",
      "semantic_role": "description",
      "source": "pdf_text"
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
